{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066247/block/singleImage/3280963/df/01M8GJ3FHHNJCCT2VKHVGJKKH3.JPG?updatedAt=1795855521\"/><figcaption>8屆冠軍馬基斯宣布今季後退役。(路透社)</figcaption></figure><p>格蘭披治電單車8屆總冠軍馬基斯（Marc Márquez），宣布今季後退役。 馬基斯於壓軸的華倫西亞站突然宣布退役，在車房展示紙牌感謝車迷支持，並擁抱車隊工作人員。他表示手臂傷勢未見好轉，加上看東西有「重影」，決定今季完結後離開賽場。</p><p>33歲的馬基斯今季在落後102分下，上一站在葡萄牙提前「封王」，成功創出史上最大反勝，奪得生涯第8個總冠軍，追平傳奇車手阿戈斯天尼（Giacomo Agostini）。 馬基斯15歲開始出戰世界錦標賽，20歲升上頂級組別，奪得超過100場不同級別的分站冠軍。</p><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 Ducati Corse（@ducaticorse）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T09:36:39.436406+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":320,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:54:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T15:13:43.209353+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T09:30:00.854318+00:00","content_hash":"dec55f87517a6675aa47c87dac64169c129a510c6f1249ec09a27dcb4eac37e9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T09:36:39.436406+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}